        whose IPv6 arm handed `inet_ntop` four bytes, is removed. A `Socket`
        holds its family as a value (`family`), and `ListenConfig.listen`
        and `NoTLSListener` default to `NetworkType.tcp`, the family the
        address names: `[::]` is IPv6 with `IPV6_V6ONLY` set to 0
        (`Socket.set_ipv6_only`), `[::1]` the IPv6 loopback, anything else
        IPv4, and `tcp6` IPv6 alone. `Server.serve` and `serve_nonblocking`
