        replacement followed (review record RP). Left rather than not
        started because the sender's second read of `state` refuses only
        left. `_word_at` is the page arithmetic `_word` now calls.

      - accept_share.mojo (2026-09-30): `close_reaped_handoffs(page,
        worker, channel, bound_ns)`, the supervisor's drain of a worker it
