        queued on that worker's channel is received and closed, the drain
        running on while `pending`, less the dead worker's `taken` and what
        it has received, is above 0, within the bound, and what it took is
        retired from `pending`. The supervisor's copy of the channel was
        never the last, so those connections stayed open, unanswered, until
        the server stopped (review record RB).

